Don't fight it. You're too valuable to die in a place like this.

36
00:04:15,537 --> 00:04:18,117
Run wild with us and our flight will be yours.

37
00:04:23,117 --> 00:04:25,297
And I will call you my son.

38
00:04:26,157 --> 00:04:27,917
Screw you, you old fart!

39
00:04:30,177 --> 00:04:34,877
Tell me, why does everyone on this ship call him Pops?

40
00:04:35,337 --> 00:04:36,537
You don't get it?

41
00:04:37,017 --> 00:04:39,277
Because he calls us sons.

42
